WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.230 --> 00:00:02.700
What's up everybody!

00:00:02.700 --> 00:00:03.700
We are Pongfinity

00:00:03.700 --> 00:00:05.060
Welcome to another episode of

00:00:05.060 --> 00:00:06.680
Challenge Pongfinity

00:00:06.700 --> 00:00:07.900
This is the series

00:00:07.900 --> 00:00:09.920
Where YOU challenge US

00:00:10.040 --> 00:00:11.480
With your craziest ideas

00:00:11.490 --> 00:00:13.180
Related to table tennis.

00:00:13.180 --> 00:00:15.160
We will go through all of your comments

00:00:15.160 --> 00:00:16.690
Pick the most creative ones

00:00:16.690 --> 00:00:18.279
And make a video out of them.

00:00:18.279 --> 00:00:19.279
If your idea gets picked

00:00:19.279 --> 00:00:20.279
We will feature it

00:00:20.279 --> 00:00:21.589
And give you a shout out.

00:00:21.589 --> 00:00:23.150
So make sure to leave your ideas

00:00:23.150 --> 00:00:25.740
In the comment-section below!

00:00:30.040 --> 00:00:32.560
William Stewart wants us to make an around
the net shot

00:00:32.560 --> 00:00:34.840
With the edge of the paddle.

00:00:35.120 --> 00:00:36.680
This should be no problem!

00:00:56.540 --> 00:00:59.520
Next up, Daniel Tran wants us to play with
a mobile phone

00:00:59.540 --> 00:01:01.039
And do an around the net shot.

00:01:01.580 --> 00:01:04.980
I have a feeling that this is going to be
a good racket!

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:06.260
Let's see.

00:02:00.400 --> 00:02:01.360
As I figured

00:02:01.520 --> 00:02:03.460
This is a good racket.

00:02:03.560 --> 00:02:06.880
Let's see how many around the net shots I
can make.

00:02:29.880 --> 00:02:32.920
Dr. Depipreeta Dutta Gupta wants us to make

00:02:32.920 --> 00:02:35.680
15 consecutive behind the back shots.

00:02:35.860 --> 00:02:37.140
Let's see how it goes.

00:03:18.020 --> 00:03:19.480
Our friend Dvysku

00:03:19.640 --> 00:03:21.170
Wants us to build a card house

00:03:21.170 --> 00:03:23.219
And spin the ball around the net

00:03:23.219 --> 00:03:25.290
And between the cards

00:03:25.290 --> 00:03:27.319
I tried it out with normal playing cards

00:03:27.319 --> 00:03:28.939
But they were not big enough

00:03:28.939 --> 00:03:32.650
So I bought these extra large playing cards

00:03:32.650 --> 00:03:35.430
And I'm going to build the card house with
these

00:03:36.180 --> 00:03:38.420
And see how it goes!

00:04:52.460 --> 00:04:56.520
Malte Reichow wants us to play table tennis
with a frying pan.

00:04:56.900 --> 00:04:58.500
I started with the knife last time

00:04:58.720 --> 00:05:02.400
So I will let you start with the frying pan
this time.

00:05:02.720 --> 00:05:04.100
Let's go!

00:07:20.340 --> 00:07:24.720
Marek Kowalski wants us to play15 seconds with
2 balls

00:07:24.720 --> 00:07:26.180
And we will have to turn around

00:07:26.180 --> 00:07:27.820
And switch hands

00:07:27.820 --> 00:07:29.660
After each shot

00:07:29.880 --> 00:07:31.680
Otto, do you get dizzy easily?

00:07:31.690 --> 00:07:35.320
Well, I haven't done this kind of stuff in
a long time

00:07:35.320 --> 00:07:36.650
So we will see.

00:07:36.650 --> 00:07:40.700
Well, I get dizzy very easily so this is probably
going to feel horrible.

00:07:40.700 --> 00:07:42.500
But let's try it out.

00:07:42.500 --> 00:07:45.600
But we will first try out with only turning
around

00:07:45.960 --> 00:07:48.520
And then if it goes well, we will switch hands also.

00:08:50.640 --> 00:08:52.140
That went quite well

00:08:52.140 --> 00:08:53.780
And we are still on our feet

00:08:53.780 --> 00:08:57.640
So let's try switching hands also.

00:09:43.880 --> 00:09:44.730
Thanks for watching guys!

00:09:44.730 --> 00:09:46.440
If you enjoyed this extra long episode

00:09:46.440 --> 00:09:48.279
Make sure to leave it a thumbs up!

00:09:48.280 --> 00:09:51.740
And check out the link in the description.

00:09:51.740 --> 00:09:53.240
If you are new to our channel

00:09:53.249 --> 00:09:54.249
Subscribe here.

00:09:54.249 --> 00:09:57.620
And watch the previous episodes here.

00:09:57.660 --> 00:10:00.300
Until next time!

